["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">髪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>头发</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">髪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头发</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">髪の毛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かみのけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头发；（一根）头发</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">白髪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しらが</span><span class=\"k-wz\">白发；灰白的头发</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">忙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>忙碌；繁忙；不安；忧虑</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ・モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いそが.しい・せわ.しい・おそ.れる・うれえるさま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">忙しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いそがしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">忙碌；繁忙；忙乱；坐立不安；匆忙；慌张；静不下来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">多忙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">非常繁忙；忙碌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">才</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>天才；年龄；才（体积单位，1立方尺约0.0278立方米）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">才能</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">才能；才华；能力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天才</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天才；天赋异禀；奇才</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">粧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>化妆；装饰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">化粧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">化妆；化妆品；彩妆；装饰；修饰；掩饰；虚饰</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">靴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>鞋</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">靴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鞋；靴子；鞋类；鞋靴</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">靴下</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くつした</span><span class=\"k-wz\">袜子；短袜；长袜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">恥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>羞耻；耻辱；羞愧；丢脸</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">は.じる・はじ・は.じらう・は.ずかしい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恥ずかしい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はずかしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">害羞的；难为情的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">羞耻；羞辱；耻辱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">恥じる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はじる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">感到羞愧；感到羞耻</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">偶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>偶然；偶数；一对；夫妇；同类</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">グウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">偶然的；不常见的；罕见的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偶然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐうぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巧合；偶然；意外；偶然性；偶然地；出乎意料地；无意中；（哲学）偶然性（与必然性相对）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偶数</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐうすう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">偶数</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">偉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>卓越；伟大；杰出；自大；著名</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">えら.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偉大</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">伟大；宏大；壮丽；杰出；雄伟</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偉い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えらい</span