</span><span class=\"k-wz\">许多；众多；多数</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">脇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>腋下；侧面；配角；另一处；旁支</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わき・わけ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腋下；臂下；侧面；侧翼；旁边；身边；靠近；邻近；一旁；偏离；置之一隅；离题；题外；配角；助演；次要角色；联句中的第二句</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鍋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>锅；壶；平底锅</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なべ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鍋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なべ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">锅；平底锅；炊具；炖菜；火锅</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">袖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>袖子；侧翼（建筑）；延伸部分；冷落（给冷遇）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そで</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">袖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そで</span><span class=\"k-wz\">袖；（舞台、书桌、门等的）侧翼；（书衣的）折口；勒口</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">頃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a cl